Recipe Schema is a PRO feature which allows you to add recipe schema and structured data to your blog posts and pages. When you provide Google with more information about a recipe, such as ratings, cooking and prep times and nutritional information, your recipe article can be presented to users in more interesting and prominent ways.

Current PRO features included in recipe schema settings:

