Events Schema is a PRO feature that will add events Schema and structured data in JSON-LD format to your posts and pages. Pages and posts properly marked up with the Event schema can benefit from being discovered more easily in the search results. The results shown to users are more interactive, and you have an increased chance of your pages being found.

Current PRO features included in events schema settings:

